$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=root1pow  LOC_AFTER=?

* The U-th root of unity is the V-th power of the ( U x. V )-th root of unity: its K-th power is the ( K x. V )-th power of the latter.

s1::simp1 |- ( ( U e. NN /\ V e. NN /\ K e. ZZ ) -> U e. NN )
