s15:s4,i14:syl |- ( ( U e. NN /\ V e. NN /\ K e. ZZ ) -> ( -u 1 ^c ( 2 / ( U x. V ) ) ) = ( exp ` ( ( 2 / ( U x. V ) ) x. ( _i x. _pi ) ) ) )
