qed:s44,s51,s54:3eqtrd |- ( ( U e. NN /\ V e. NN /\ K e. ZZ ) -> ( ( -u 1 ^c ( 2 / U ) ) ^ K ) = ( ( -u 1 ^c ( 2 / ( U x. V ) ) ) ^ ( K x. V ) ) )
